opus.root_cause:
spec.mjs (ENUMS and per-block branches 211-264) has no checks for:
- type `through`;
- lockup `cast`;
- roster agents[].mascot;
- scene speed / every / rate / size / width, and until vs at;
- stack pillAt.

The blocks coerce with `Number(x) || default`. stack.js:14 calls F.at without a `what`. Roster text has no fit.

opus.fix:
Errors in spec.mjs:
- type through: true, false or a frame count ≥ 0;
- lockup cast: a whole number 0–6 or false;
- roster agents[].mascot: a whole number ≥ 0 (roster can't draw spark/logo);
- scene speed / every / rate / size / width > 0 and until > at;
- stack pillAt via isAt, and pass `stack ${s.id} pillAt` to F.at.

Add a roster fit (shrink the sub to the frame) or a warning for long names/subs. Only input that was silently wrong starts to error.
